WEBVTT

00:30:29.833 --> 00:30:32.101
when you made fun of me
for liking comic books.

00:30:32.125 --> 00:30:33.726
EP: No, but it's a wish to think

00:30:33.750 --> 00:30:38.268
that you can create the response
of the other person.

00:30:38.292 --> 00:30:40.518
What you can do is what you can do.

00:30:40.542 --> 00:30:42.351
AG: Yeah.
EP: It's your part.

00:30:42.375 --> 00:30:43.976
And then yes,

00:30:44.000 --> 00:30:46.309
this moment where you wait to see

00:30:46.333 --> 00:30:50.226
if what you put in
is going to create the thing you get back,

00:30:50.250 --> 00:30:52.268
that is the vulnerability moment.

00:30:52.292 --> 00:30:54.143
AG: Yeah, and I
don't like that moment.

00:30:54.167 --> 00:30:56.143
EP: That is the moment you can't control.

00:30:56.167 --> 00:30:58.518
EP: You don't like it.
AG: I don't like it at all.

00:30:58.542 --> 00:31:00.393
And I don't like it in part because --